{
  "engine": "qwen",
  "identity": "A woman around thirty. A low, soft alto with a little breath in it, plain North American accent. She is cold, tired, and talking quietly to herself in an empty place; never theatrical, never narrating.",
  "clips": [
    {
      "text": "\"Stay in.\" She's the one out there, and she's telling me to stay in.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "4ee2ce4a0c98cb4bbd66fae92518b993f2bcd09d112b2e3e36db6b31b617f4c9.wav",
      "seconds": 4.672041666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8064448833465576,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Two cups. She packed for both of us. She knew I'd come.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "17fd7082c4f7d17491c36ede7b844c02fd7139b0c22d29d26fce2d39e9d4e28e.wav",
      "seconds": 4.606958333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8035738468170166,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then I heard it again, from the trees. Okay. I won't answer. I won't.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "a050137b5cf807934b4c3d94bca70c37745dd7cc1df5a693b3c6b777ce75945b.wav",
      "seconds": 8.233208333333334,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6346792578697205,
      "engine": "qwen-design",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prints that just stop. She's describing mine. I haven't been to the pines yet. Have I?",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "e2838a94d1ceca6231ed9b9cee94000818cb0b560e858d6ef736c9c73237298c.wav",
      "seconds": 6.875333333333334,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8122336268424988,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "That's my handwriting. That's how I make my M's.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "b610104be3f855bcdd85aab03852fbd742258be7d8b70184ce3c6a4a3e90cba4.wav",
      "seconds": 3.6882083333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7604011297225952,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't turn around. Fine. I won't. Just be at the lights.",
      "mood": "resolve",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "eff959d41255497ab7c465b57cd97801a32704b87a4b9974af6307fc9daf83b1.wav",
      "seconds": 5.4290416666666665,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8186920881271362,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "One cup. Just one. I'm not lifting that sheet. I'm not.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "03742d079929e91ac272576277f7314d30bffcee608af94b844d96e2d92e0f33.wav",
      "seconds": 5.426916666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8017343282699585,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "She left the door open for me. Or for herself. She never could decide which of us needed rescuing.",
      "mood": "warm",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "b27040aa1e8fbde58747f6aec660c82bd38074e4321893f71cd597342aba5e3c.wav",
      "seconds": 7.402166666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6615484356880188,
      "engine": "qwen-design",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign"
    },
    {
      "text": "One cup. The intake said one cup. I'm not counting again. I'm not.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "b47fd982e0f5d888ee18738b3c3d2f862e63a0d45342aaff1875955f027ed888.wav",
      "seconds": 7.1645,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6454510688781738,
      "engine": "qwen-design",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign"
    },
    {
      "text": "It knew my name. It used my name on her.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "961a6d951167c69b83ef56885ae7134244e7208bc9f1e06422f6633471465a83.wav",
      "seconds": 3.631875,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7309876680374146,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Smaller than mine. Then not. Like the prints were growing into me.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "4382ee932249f921da433ece3a999976f2328b724a9ac4db0ce00c6da27e0b5f.wav",
      "seconds": 4.847833333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7625163793563843,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Same hand, both pages. I'd know it anywhere. That's what scares me.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "fd318cd6d9045730e559cfa4daae174b9a82d08aa96558beca681645d313d08a.wav",
      "seconds": 5.490208333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8501206040382385,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "The sheet is not her. The sheet is not her. I'll say it all the way to the road.",
      "mood": "resolve",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "69fc6801e6d8273919ed7b72f1fecb84e5657e194726d677ca54e2da078ef545.wav",
      "seconds": 6.061,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8316149711608887,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just an M. It could be either of us. It could be both.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "b66750312e0b3c028a69c70e2c67048da8bb9db1dde2ae897275f3eca212a086.wav",
      "seconds": 4.266708333333334,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7958230972290039,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her side of the bed is still warm. She can't be far.",
      "mood": "warm",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "a5c5be2903354ea774e21ed3533775ceece4c291cf59f2f4abf79e5048eee652.wav",
      "seconds": 3.680875,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7696252465248108,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her boots are gone. The door isn't even latched.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "d5a5327d362a462c33a90261a06e05bd6bcd82079ab3e07686c617b624b8ff84.wav",
      "seconds": 3.8960833333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8565976619720459,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Two chairs pulled out. She sat up with that candle until it went out.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "99c5b1fd555b9c2b29cbc059875ee7ca89a5359ce4cfc400d8878454a6c17e87.wav",
      "seconds": 6.446791666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6271554231643677,
      "engine": "qwen-design",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mathilda? She wouldn't go down there. She hates the cellar.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "19612fc3409ad87562bc8121351898fe5fff4af43e757983a120da2288360018.wav",
      "seconds": 4.364083333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8242409825325012,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "If she's down here, she's been quiet a long time.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "2580683fd1faac2be239ee99b6004d9b8204f7df2016f03fd416457e2bd1e674.wav",
      "seconds": 3.1308333333333334,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6964184045791626,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "No wind down here. Just my heart, and I wish it would slow down.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "ce080064281c999fce20e459e92a3ead625dbd0aec632a2efa4bd8bb60cd895c.wav",
      "seconds": 7.415583333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6173141002655029,
      "engine": "qwen-design",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign"
    },
    {
      "text": "Why does a cabin need a hallway this long under the ground?",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "8119c52ffc83b4e3d1c7380db60b2f594b4a261989575895e0f6085210bc75e8.wav",
      "seconds": 3.8396666666666666,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6513063907623291,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Someone keeps this place clean. Someone expects to use it.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "83459668a44711c6cdd0ab9ab17768cfdb3abfe2be01d7b1ef459fedda5ffcf8.wav",
      "seconds": 4.585166666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6725999116897583,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "No. She wouldn't be here. She's out in the snow. She has to be.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "eff4e0956f1c832306c3b05ca7c98fc395a7018d4abf42973e8cf97296896afa.wav",
      "seconds": 4.889166666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8060165643692017,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her prints are already filling in. I have to be faster than the snow.",
      "mood": "resolve",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "b5ce26d23d18a359f28f79ff1efc4cf082b7b747459d174259b972a0b2c93143.wav",
      "seconds": 4.643041666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7706809043884277,
      "engine": "qwen-clone",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base"
    },
    {
      "text": "Headlights. Someone's waiting. Please let it be her.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "a6ef5b81bd0803955edb6bed215f57bc823a0c063fdd7411499cb377d313add8.wav",
      "seconds": 5.816208333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6250524520874023,
      "engine": "qwen-design",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign"
    },
